# ── Legacy wraptorstricity.com URLs (WordPress site this replaces) ──
# Source: SEO-MIGRATION-AUDIT.md / SEO-URL-MAPPING.csv — Tri-City's own
# sitemaps, a crawl of its internal links and its WordPress REST API
# (pages, posts, categories, users, media and the hidden "ufaq" FAQ type),
# checked 2026-10-30. Every target was checked against this build.
#
# Conventions (Netlify):
# - Every target is the final trailing-slash URL. Pages are prerendered to
#   <route>/index.html, which Netlify serves at /<route>/ and 301s
#   /<route> to, so a slash-less target would add a second hop.
# - Netlify strips the trailing slash before matching, so each rule also
#   covers the slash-less copies the old site served (e.g. /services/decals).
# - Static files win over these rules. Old URLs that are real pages again
#   need no rule: /, /services/, /services/caliper-painting/,
#   /services/wheel-painting/, /faqs/, /gallery/, /locations/, /videos/,
#   /articles/ (and /about/, which the old site redirected itself).
# - Specific rules come before splats (Netlify uses the first match).
# - Domain variants (bare domain, http) are handled by setting
#   www.wraptorstricity.com as the primary domain in Netlify.

